# Hopeful Initiate's training (CR 702.149a): "Whenever this creature and at least one other creature with power greater than
# this creature's power attack, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature." On turn 3 the 1/2 Initiate attacks with Woodland
# Changeling (2/2): training triggers, and Bot2 Lightning Bolts the Changeling in response - the counter is still put (the
# ruling: the other creature dying doesn't stop it). On turn 5 the Initiate, now 2/3, attacks with Elvish Spirit Guide (2/2):
# equal power is not greater, so nothing triggers. On turn 7 it attacks alone while Yargle, Glutton of Urborg (9/3) stays
# home: a greater power that doesn't attack makes nothing trigger.

